    (property "Note" "On the lid, wired by CBL-MCU-RIBBON. Its own LDO is the instrument's only 3V3. Pins are its pads as the ribbon reaches them: the pad rows; TP2 (VCC_5V) and TP3 (GND), its extension test pads; EN at Key1's RESET-side terminal and IO0 at Key2's (BOOT) IO0-side terminal - the sides on R8/R10, not on GND [datasheets/mechanical/WAVESHARE-ESP32-S3-MATRIX-SCHEMATIC.pdf]. IO2 to IO6 are SPARE (IO5 and IO6 since ADR 0015, IO2 since ADR 0016; IO3 and IO4 have no assignment); IO2 and IO3 reach J-MCU, IO4 to IO6 do not" (at 40.64 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
    (property "Pins_source" "A stand-in: the Matrix is on the lid (on_board no), and its pins are its pads as the ribbon reaches them, numbered in netlist order" (at 40.64 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
